The file `fontes/Exo-Bold.ttf` is a binary font file and cannot be generated as text content. You will need to obtain the actual font file from a legitimate source or create it using a font creation tool. If you have the font file on your local machine, you can simply place it in the specified directory (`gerador-cardapio/fontes/`). 

